WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.829
This slide focuses on Why sequences matter in
analytics Start with what the structure

00:00:05.855 --> 00:00:11.416
represents then connect that idea to the example on
the slide In

00:00:11.442 --> 00:00:17.248
analytics one observation is rarely enough Lists and
tuples let us group related

00:00:17.274 --> 00:00:22.366
values and work with them as one object List an
ordered collection that can be

00:00:22.392 --> 00:00:28.852
changed Tuple an ordered collection that should stay
fixed Index

00:00:29.089 --> 00:00:31.537
a position number used to access a value
